    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_fossil_fuels_mineral_oils): 'Mineral or Earth Oil' is petroleum (Canadian exports in gallons, incl. Sarnia ON → United States); same commodity as htc:0840/htc:1056. Layer-1 observations: 2 rows, 1882–1882. Series: CSP_Canadian_Exports_BlankSeries (inferred, series not printed) ×2. Units: Gallons ×2. Top routes: Quebec → Newfoundland ×1; Quebec → All Countries ×1."@en ;
